{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.alone",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "课结束了，她一个人收东西",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.alone",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.alone",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────好的好的。非常抱歉……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（楼层经理在跟她说什么。她低着头。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "是的…………",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "辛苦了──制作人先生────",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──啊，嗯。我马上过去！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（跟はづきさん联络一下……）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────哦，にちか！辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "自主练习吗。要沿着河跑的话小心点──我出去一趟。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊，好的────",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，喂喂……！……是，是……！嗯，那明天的────",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──好，那今天也加油吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊，好的。加油的是我哦……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "制作人先生今天不来陪课吧，上课？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……是啊。抱歉。加油啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "好──完全没有，我一直都很努力哦────",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──啊，不好。电话……结束的时候我来接你！去吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────诶？动作不是这周开始教吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……指导老师的声音从门缝里传出来。）",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……啊──啊哈哈，是这样啊──",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "辛苦了──咦，制作人先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "不在啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……13 点某某公司，14 点彩排站场，16 点广播碰头，16 点半例会，17 点半顺路去摄影棚",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────…………",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────制──作──人──先──生────！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇，抱歉…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "等的时候在听音频资料……！抱歉，上车吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────…………忙的话，我走路回去哦──",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，にちか！？不行不行，那怎么可能。上车────",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那我走了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "能不能别演忙了────！？",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────……にちか",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "也没什么……又不是只有制作人先生忙──",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个────",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……我也是──────…………",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "……很辛苦吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "……我不忙的。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "……我看上去像那样吗。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "比我……要辛苦得多。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……那不是在骗人吗──！？",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "明明超级忙────",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "是工作嘛！全都是重要的！和我这种……外行做着梦的不一样！",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……にちか……？为什么────",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……那，辛苦了！公交要来了，我先走了哦──！",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……！にちか…………！にちか，等等。",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈哈哈，有空的话请来看哦──，外行的舞！",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────为什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "109"
      },
      "109": {
        "id": "109",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "にちか，等等……等等────"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……────────",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "────哇……糟糕，这话好阴阳怪气。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "制作人先生要是不忙，那我岂不是超级糟糕的人！超闲的一般人──！",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "可以哦！不用把时间花在不成为工作的事情上──",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊哈哈，移动之类自己来就好了嘛！毕竟在追梦啊！　那我────",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎、怎么了……？我真的是────",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────……我的辛苦，跟にちか的比起来根本不算什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……啊，公交好像要来了，我先走了哦──明天也麻烦你来接──！",
        "nextNodeId": "128"
      },
      "128": {
        "id": "128",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，にち────────…………"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……不是那样的吗──！好厉害！！",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "明明工作超级多、电话也一直打来、完全没时间待在事务所，可是不忙呢──！",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "────……にちか，那个──────",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "如果我看上去很忙，那也是，全部都是为了にちか。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "……哇，全部之类的话说得超级随便吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不是，不随便啊。该怎么说才好──────",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "啊！不用了完全！反正超级忙，别把时间花在这种无所谓的说明上──！",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "那，我时间很多的，慢慢去练习室哦──！不打扰你了，资料检查加油──！",
        "nextNodeId": "148"
      },
      "148": {
        "id": "148",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……にちか────────────等等…………"
      }
    }
  },
